{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50450","headline":"六二 · 王梵志","name":"六二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无心莫充保，（「无心」，伯三六五六卷作「无亲」。\n）无事莫作媒。\n（「无事」，伯三七一六卷作「无女」。\n）虽悉乡人意，（「悉」，伯三五五八、伯三六五六、斯三三九三卷作「失」，斯二七一○卷作「识」。\n）终身无害灾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50450.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50450","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}